          "text": "Bilateral leg pain on walking"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Crampy, heavy ache in both calves, possibly also thighs; right worse than left. Occurs after a few minutes of walking, for example from the train to school, and eases after a few minutes of rest. Onset is unclear: patient alternates between last week and a few months ago. No nocturnal pain."
