        },
        "dosageInstruction": [
          {
            "text": "Take 1 tablet orally each morning. Take away from tea, coffee, and dairy where possible; may take with a small amount of food if gastrointestinal upset occurs. Continue for at least 3 months after haemoglobin normalises, then for a further 3 months to replenish stores; total duration approximately 3–6 months depending on results. If poorly tolerated daily, may trial alternate days and let the clinician know.",
